"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110025.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-02T02:37:27Z"},"body":"Supersedes #109656.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106881\r\n\r\nI pointed out some issues in the original PR but I figured it'd be easier to just re-do it with these changes in mind. Regardless, thanks to @ydeltastar for providing a starting point to fix this.\r\n\r\nOne concern I have with this fix is that, if this command line option is used, the generated shader baker cache will be effectively useless unless the template itself also runs with the option enabled. We can either figure out a way to make the shader baker work independently of this (definitely takes a lot of refactoring work) or we can just warn/block the shader baker from working while this option is enabled.\r\n\r\nRegardless, this PR should be an improvement over the current situation.\r\n\r\n### TODO\r\n- [x] Add warning if setting is enabled when using shader baker.","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110